 succeeded in 145ms:
181: | `linear` | derived from `tlb_mode > 3` -- **NOT an independent axis** |
182: | incoming `x`, `y` | `< 0` / in-range / `>= 2048` where evaluated.  **There is no `x == 0` or `y == 0` test**, and a later `y &= 127` changes the value a mutant sees |
183: | tiled `tile_nr` | `< 256` / `>= 256`.  *** NO ZERO/NONZERO TEST EXISTS *** |
184: | linear `tile_nr` | `< 32` / `>= 32` **after reassignment `tile_nr = x >> 12` -- a DIFFERENT value from the tiled calculation** |
